From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frida Hou <Frida-a@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:03:54 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [Attention] FlashInfer: --kv-cache-dtype k8v4 (FP8 keys +
 NVFP4 values)

New KV cache dtype k8v4 (KVQuantMode.K8V4): one slot per KV head with
D + D/2 + D/16 bytes, split-plane HND pages. FlashInfer backend only
(SM100/SM120), kernel pages <= 64, HND layout forced. The builder plans it
as fp8_e4m3 (same page indices, FP8-Q prefill, SM120 compact gather forced
on); the impl writes with k8v4_store, prefills on dense FP8 pages from
k8v4_gather_pages (SM120 cute-dsl-prims) or k8v4_mock_paged (SM100
trtllm-gen context) and decodes / verifies with the Triton k8v4_decode
(BF16 Q, XQA/trtllm-gen decode metadata). No q pre-quantization or output
quant fusion. Every other cache dtype takes the unchanged code path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 vllm/config/cache.py                     |   4 +
 vllm/utils/torch_utils.py                |   1 +
 vllm/v1/attention/backends/flashinfer.py | 123 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 vllm/v1/kv_cache_interface.py            |   5 +
 4 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

